# Input

```html
<div></div>

text at the top level after a blank line

<div>
  <span />

  text inside an element after a blank line
</div>

<p>
  <span />

  text after an inline element
</p>

```


# Formatted

```html
<div></div>

text at the top level after a blank line

<div>
	<span />

	text inside an element after a blank line
</div>

<p>
	<span />

	text after an inline element
</p>

```
